  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      262.15,
      204.29,
      397.18,
      291.23
    ],
    "text": "Provided that, the provisionsof this secion shall not beapplicable in an event, a party toan action seeks to produce anydeed or document not included inthe pleadings of that party at anyproceedings under this Code.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
