    "bbox": [
      229.15,
      305.09,
      397.16,
      341.63
    ],
    "text": "(2) The provisions of subsection (1),shall mutatis mutandis apply in the actionson summary procedure under this Code.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
